  articleID: 'https://NewManilaBotanicalGardens/Obituary '
  title: Motumbe
  headliner: '<b>Beloved Silverback Fatally Shot After Child Falls Into Enclosure
    !

    >'
  bodyText: 'A quiet afternoon at the New Manila Botanical Gardens ended in profound
    sorrow yesterday following the tragic loss of Motumbe, a 17-year-old silverback
    gorilla who was fatally shot by zoo response teams after a four-year-old boy
    slipped into the primate habitat. '
  textBeforeUrl: 'More about this story :'
  externalLinkBodyText: 'Emergency officials stated that lethal action was taken
    out of immediate concern for the child''s life as the 450-pound animal dragged
    the boy through the enclosure''s moat, though eyewitnesses and heartbroken visitors
    questioned whether the gentle giant was merely attempting to protect the frightened
    child. '
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - THIS IS TOO MUCH FOR MY HEART TO BEAR !
  - "I feel there is a shift in our timeline with this death\u2026"
  - "I understand having to shoot him, but it doesn't make it any easier\u2026"
  - "This doesn't feel real, it can't be real, I don't want it to be\u2026"
